            "dct:description": {
                "@language": "eng",
                "@value": "This dataset contains variables describing employment status, employment contract and salary conditions. All variables concerning jobs are related to a reference period (year and month) capturing professional trajectories. \nThis dataset is part of those provided by the IGSS within the framework of the Luxembourg Microdata Platform on Labour and Social Protection. All datasets offered by the IGSS are designed to be interoperable through the use of common pseudonymized identifiers, enabling the linkage of information across different datasets. \nAll the variables in this dataset are personal data and are subject to GDPR compliant protection measures. \nScope: all jobs held by workers affiliated to the Luxembourg social security system and carried out in companies registered in Luxembourg. \nDelay for providing the most recent data: current month -3. \nData sources : CCSS,  ADEM."
            },
            "dct:spatial": {
                "@id": "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"
